{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le01ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le01ob02re2img02.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le01ob02re2img02.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn6le01ob02re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What is your mum doing now that you're back on your own? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: She's working through her daily routine again: cleaning, cooking, washing.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: How old is she?  Can I ask that?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: She turns 46 soon. We have a big party for her every year. She's outgoing and loves family gatherings.  <br>", "id": 1, "time": "1"}, {"image": "engenn6le01ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What's your dad like? You mentioned he's grumpy sometimes. How grumpy does he get? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, he can be quite irritable when he's overworked, and a bit short-tempered. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: My family seems so different! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How different can it be? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, I come from a small family. They are exceptionally quiet. They hardly speak. They're always reading. <br>", "id": 2, "time": "21000"}, {"image": "engenn6le01ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You are always in the kitchen banging pots and pans! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I rarely bang pots.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I know. You are so in your element when you cook. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm still learning. I am constantly finding new ways to combine flavor and food. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I am getting more and more organized. Blogging about my travels every day helped with that. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Look at us! Young confident working women! <br>", "id": 3, "time": "46000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can ask about family members, their habits and traits.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about behavior and personality.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about what people are doing.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What things do you do with your family during the week?  On weekends? On holidays?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's talk about family!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Vanessa <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">is in her element</span> when she cooks.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": [{"content": "To <s