Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to ask about families.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About Family", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about family, you often describe the behavior and  personalities of the people in your family.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Behavior is the way a person  acts or conducts themselves.<span class=\"italic\"> <br>Example: Tom is usually relaxed, but today he seems nervous.</span> <br><br>Personality is a person's  general character (they way they are). <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Sandra is a tidy person. Her apartment is always clean and neat.</span> <br><br> We use adjectives to talk about behavior and personality.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":13,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"creative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"artistic; has original ideas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"loud\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"often speaks at full volume\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"angry\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"annoyed; hostile\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sweet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"even-tempered; pleasant\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bookish\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"always reading\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"grumpy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"crabby; bad-tempered\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"zany\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"eccentric; unusual\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"outgoing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"friendly; socially confident\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"irritable\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"easily annoyed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"short-tempered\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"easy to anger\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"quiet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"silent; still\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"confident\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"positive; self-assured\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "He can be a little grumpy sometimes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She never gets upset or angry.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "My cousin is really creative - he works as a graphic designer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I can be a little short-tempered.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Simple Present Tense versus The Present Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Present tense and the Present Continuous tense to talk about the present in different ways. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the Simple Present tense: <br> <ul><li>to talk about things that are always true </li><li>to give general information </li><li>to talk about habits and routines </li><li>to talk about feelings (stative verbs)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the Present Continuous tense: <ul><li>to talk about an action happening now </li><li>to talk about things happening around now </li><li>to talk about things that are changing", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Present Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I read all the time.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm reading a good book this week.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We have a new car.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Tom is buying a new car today.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Water boils at 100 degrees C.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The water in the kettle is boiling.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to clean", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to tidy and do housework", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have to clean before my family arrives! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to wash", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do the laundry", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Tom washes his clothes on Saturdays. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "irritable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "easily annoyed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Dad is irritable when he's tired. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "over-worked", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having worked too long and too hard ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Dad feels over-worked when he has a tight deadline. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "short-tempered", "type": "name"}, {"content": "easily angered ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Ted is short-tempered, so watch what you say to him.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to bang", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to hit and make noise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She's banging pots and pans in the kitchen. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "organized", "type": "name"}, {"content": "being orderly and efficient ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She is always so organized! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le01ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write about 3 people you know well.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use adjectives to describe their personalities and their everyday lives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short paragraph for each person with 25-30 words in each paragraph.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your paragraphs to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about 3 people I know.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe their personalities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe their everyday lives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my descriptions aloud.", "type": "text"}]}]}